<div class="aq-page"><section class="aq-section aq-band--limestone aq-option-tags-sec"><div class="aq-in aq-stack-l"><div class="aq-fold" id="fold-2"><div class="aq-option-tags"><div class="aq-option-tags__label"><header class="aq-sec-head"><h2 class="aq-h1">Configurations and options</h2></header><p class="aq-option-tags__base"><span class="aq-spot aq-spot--icon aq-spot--muted aq-option-tags__base-ic" aria-hidden="true" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(assets/icons/ro-membrane.svg);mask-image:url(assets/icons/ro-membrane.svg)"></span><span>Base skid · Purified Water (PW) generation</span></p></div><ol class="aq-option-tags__list"><li class="aq-option-tags__item aq-option-tags__item--tag" style="--r:-3.5deg;--c:2;--rw:1"><svg class="aq-option-tags__string" viewBox="0 0 100 60" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M100 30C70 34 60 8 30 18S8 50 0 44"></path></svg><div class="aq-option-tags__tag"><span class="aq-option-tags__eyelet" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="aq-option-tags__body"><h3 class="aq-option-tags__t">Membrane degasser</h3><p class="aq-option-tags__d">Strips carbon dioxide ahead of EDI without dosing caustic, where feed alkalinity is high.</p><span class="aq-option-tags__foot" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-option-tags__stamp"><span class="aq-spot aq-spot--icon aq-option-tags__glyph" aria-hidden="true" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(assets/icons/ro-membrane.svg);mask-image:url(assets/icons/ro-membrane.svg)"></span></span><span class="aq-option-tags__no">01</span></span></div></div></li><li class="aq-option-tags__item aq-option-tags__item--tag" style="--r:2.5deg;--c:1;--rw:2"><svg class="aq-option-tags__string" viewBox="0 0 100 60" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M100 30C70 34 60 8 30 18S8 50 0 44"></path></svg><div class="aq-option-tags__tag"><span class="aq-option-tags__eyelet" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="aq-option-tags__body"><h3 class="aq-option-tags__t">Duplex trains</h3><p class="aq-option-tags__d">Two trains at <span class="aq-ph">[duplex train shares offered]</span> each: one runs while the other is sanitized.</p><span class="aq-option-tags__foot" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-option-tags__stamp"><span class="aq-spot aq-spot--icon aq-option-tags__glyph" aria-hidden="true" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(assets/icons/ro-membrane.svg);mask-image:url(assets/icons/ro-membrane.svg)"></span></span><span class="aq-option-tags__no">02</span></span></div></div></li><li class="aq-option-tags__item aq-option-tags__item--round" style="--r:0deg;--c:2;--rw:2"><svg class="aq-option-tags__string" viewBox="0 0 100 60" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M50 60C46 40 58 22 50 0"></path></svg><div class="aq-option-tags__tag"><span class="aq-option-tags__eyelet" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="aq-option-tags__body"><h3 class="aq-option-tags__t">Recirculation at no demand</h3><p class="aq-option-tags__d">Circulates when storage is full, so water never stands in the membranes.</p><span class="aq-option-tags__foot" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-option-tags__stamp"><span class="aq-spot aq-spot--icon aq-option-tags__glyph" aria-hidden="true" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(assets/icons/loop.svg);mask-image:url(assets/icons/loop.svg)"></span></span><span class="aq-option-tags__no">03</span></span></div></div></li><li class="aq-option-tags__item aq-option-tags__item--folder aq-fold-x" style="--r:2deg;--c:3;--rw:1"><div class="aq-option-tags__tag"><div class="aq-option-tags__body"><h3 class="aq-option-tags__t">Ultrafiltration or 254 nm UV</h3><p class="aq-option-tags__d">After DI or EDI, where your microbial target needs more margin. Ultraviolet (UV) lowers the viable count; it does not sanitize.</p><span class="aq-option-tags__foot" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-option-tags__stamp"><span class="aq-spot aq-spot--icon aq-option-tags__glyph" aria-hidden="true" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(assets/icons/uv.svg);mask-image:url(assets/icons/uv.svg)"></span></span><span class="aq-option-tags__no">04</span></span></div></div></li><li class="aq-option-tags__item aq-option-tags__item--folder aq-fold-x" style="--r:-2.5deg;--c:3;--rw:2"><div class="aq-option-tags__tag"><div class="aq-option-tags__body"><h3 class="aq-option-tags__t">Recovery enhancement</h3><p class="aq-option-tags__d">A concentrate recovery RO stage cuts water to drain where sewer charges or supply limits matter.</p><span class="aq-option-tags__foot" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-option-tags__stamp"><span class="aq-spot aq-spot--icon aq-option-tags__glyph" aria-hidden="true" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(assets/icons/pump.svg);mask-image:url(assets/icons/pump.svg)"></span></span><span class="aq-option-tags__no">05</span></span></div></div></li></ol><svg class="aq-option-tags__vial aq-option-tags__vial--a" viewBox="0 0 40 120" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect class="aq-option-tags__cap" x="11" y="2" width="18" height="14"></rect><path d="M13 16v8h14v-8"></path><path d="M8 28q0-4 4-4h16q4 0 4 4v80q0 10-12 10t-12-10z"></path><path class="aq-option-tags__liquid" d="M8 70h24"></path><rect class="aq-option-tags__lab" x="10" y="38" width="20" height="22"></rect><path class="aq-option-tags__hair" d="M13 45h14M13 50h10"></path></svg><svg class="aq-option-tags__vial aq-option-tags__vial--b" viewBox="0 0 40 120" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect class="aq-option-tags__cap" x="11" y="2" width="18" height="14"></rect><path d="M13 16v8h14v-8"></path><path d="M8 28q0-4 4-4h16q4 0 4 4v80q0 10-12 10t-12-10z"></path><path class="aq-option-tags__liquid" d="M8 70h24"></path><rect class="aq-option-tags__lab" x="10" y="38" width="20" height="22"></rect><path class="aq-option-tags__hair" d="M13 45h14M13 50h10"></path></svg></div><button type="button" class="aq-fold__btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="fold-2" data-more="Show all 5 options">Show all 5 options</button></div></div></section></